<title>FINLAND: Nokia 9-month net sales by business group.</title>
<headline>Nokia 9-month net sales by business group.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy on Thursday gave the following breakdown by business group of its nine-month net sales (million markka):</p>
<p>					   Jan-Sept 1996     Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p> Telecommunications		     9,134		 7,099</p>
<p> Mobile Phones			   14,440		10,855</p>
<p> General Communications products    3,629		 5,082</p>
<p> Discontinued, divested operations    nil		 3,265</p>
<p> Intra-group eliminations		-551		  -446</p>
<p> TOTAL				     26,652		25,855</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
